(vector (map (:db/id -1)
  (:adr/id "2607206700")
  (:adr/doc_type "adr")
  (:adr/status :accepted)
  (:adr/date "2026-07-20")
  (:adr/title "West-manifest multirepo cleanup audit: projects/ legacy submodule removal, actor-externalization verification, and SessionStart branch-sync-check hook")
  (:adr/source-format "edn")
  (:adr/related (vector "2606241600" "2607171600"))
  (:adr/context "Owner asked to find and refactor leftover monorepo-era (10-.../20-...-style numbered) folder organization across gftdcojp root, app-aozora, and other repos toward the west-manifest multirepo model. Investigation found this superproject and several child repos (etzhayyim/root, gftdcojp/ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp, jk-luxury/club-shinshi) already have mature, ADR-governed migration processes in flight (e.g. etzhayyim/root ADR-2607171100, Phase 0 freeze + `-MOVED.edn` tombstones), plus extremely heavy concurrent multi-agent activity that completed most candidate work independently while it was being investigated in this session. Separately, the working superproject branch (agent/pin-docs-edn-only) was found to have silently diverged 848 commits / 592 files / 563k+ inserted lines from origin/main, undetected because the existing 'always sync with main' rule in CLAUDE.md was prose-only with no automatic enforcement.")
  (:adr/decision "(1) Delete the six pre-west git-submodule-era clones under superproject `projects/` after preserving any real uncommitted WIP (ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp had 172 files of genuine mangaka-pipeline work, committed and pushed to `origin/agent/mangaka-quality-pipeline` before removal; the other five were clean/orphaned and removed directly). (2) Verify rather than blindly refactor each remaining candidate: app-aozora's own `ACTOR-REPOSITORY-POLICY.md` already restricts externalization to `20-actors` domain actors (already done) and treats its other numbered folders as intentional permanent structure; gftdcojp/ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp's 8 previously-unmigrated `20-actors/*` entries were confirmed fully migrated (tombstoned, then the whole `20-actors` dir removed) by a concurrent PR (#1554/#1555) landed mid-session; jk-luxury/club-shinshi's `20-actors` and node_modules cruft were likewise already drained by a prior PR (#30) mid-session, with one small genuine unlanded WIP (a kotoba-wasm smoke test on `rescue/wip-20260718`) rescued via PR #31; kotoba-lang org (1583 repos) was scanned exhaustively and has zero repos with the bundled-numbered-layer anti-pattern; etzhayyim/root's `20-actors`/`10-protocol`/`30-graph` layers were already 100% migrated, and by the time a pilot `60-apps` extraction was attempted, `60-apps` itself (248 dirs, 579M) had already been fully drained by concurrent sessions (culminating PR referenced by that repo's own history, 2026-07-19/20) — no pilot extraction was performed because there was nothing left unclaimed. (3) Resolved the 848-commit branch divergence per `git-cleanup-conflict`/content-containment (not rebase): pushed the stale branch to its own remote as a backup, then built a fresh branch off current `origin/main` containing only the genuinely-novel subset (~130 files: `contracts/lexicons/*.edn`, new `90-docs/adr|evidence|migration` files, one added npm script, one hand-merged feature in `scripts/adr-ledger-append.cljs`), explicitly excluding a banned git-submodule gitlink (`orgs/kotoba-lang/industry`) and two files of unverified provenance (`orgs/gftdcojp/minimax-m2-modal/*`, `orgs/personal/bin/*`) — landed as PR #828, left open for human review given its size and the exclusions. (4) Added `.claude/hooks/session-start-branch-sync-check.cljs`, registered on the `SessionStart` hook in `.claude/settings.json`, to make the ahead/behind check against origin/main automatic every session instead of relying on the agent remembering the CLAUDE.md rule; documented in CLAUDE.md and landed via PR #827 (merged).")
  (:adr/execution
  (map (:projects-cleanup (map (:removed (vector "ai-gftd-lf-case-lingling" "ghosthacker" "webmaster" "spirit-in-physics" "260208-spirit-in-physics" "ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp"))
                       (:reclaimed-bytes-approx "9GB")
                       (:wip-preserved (map (:branch "agent/mangaka-quality-pipeline") (:repo "gftdcojp/ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp") (:files 172)))))
   (:app-aozora (map (:verdict :no-action-needed) (:policy-doc "20-actors/ACTOR-REPOSITORY-POLICY.md")))
   (:ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp (map (:verdict :already-migrated-by-concurrent-work) (:pull-requests (vector 1554 1555)) (:west-pin-advanced "7ba47a934020b3567d574373e2b822e23cdcfd44")))
   (:club-shinshi (map (:verdict :already-migrated-by-concurrent-work) (:pull-requests (vector 30)) (:rescue-pull-request 31) (:west-pin-advanced "6e66ca3c0f9ec4a964f60d218d2ae4a41c54c71a")))
   (:kotoba-lang (map (:repos-scanned 1583) (:bundled-numbered-layer-matches 0)))
   (:etzhayyim-root (map (:layers-fully-migrated (vector "10-protocol" "20-actors" "30-graph"))
                    (:layer-fully-drained-mid-session "60-apps")
                    (:pilot-extraction-attempted true)
                    (:pilot-extraction-result :no-unclaimed-candidate-remained)
                    (:remaining-numbered-layers (vector "00-contracts" "50-clients" "50-infra" "70-tools" "80-data"))))
   (:branch-divergence (map (:branch "agent/pin-docs-edn-only") (:ahead 848) (:behind 1607) (:files-changed 592)
                        (:backup-remote "origin/agent/pin-docs-edn-only")
                        (:cleanup-pull-request 828) (:cleanup-files-landed 130)
                        (:excluded-from-cleanup (vector "orgs/kotoba-lang/industry (submodule gitlink)"
                                                 "orgs/gftdcojp/minimax-m2-modal/* (unverified provenance)"
                                                 "orgs/personal/bin/* (unverified provenance)"))))
   (:session-start-hook (map (:file ".claude/hooks/session-start-branch-sync-check.cljs")
                         (:registered-in ".claude/settings.json")
                         (:pull-request 827) (:merged true)
                         (:thresholds (map (:ahead 30) (:behind 30)))))))
  (:adr/verification "Manually pipe-tested the SessionStart hook script directly and via its exact wrapped settings.json command; validated .claude/settings.json with `jq -e`; confirmed via GitHub API compare (not local shallow ancestry) that every `(forced update)` / `unrelated histories` signal encountered this session was a shallow-clone false positive, never a real force-push; verified PR #828's CI failures (`Analyze (python)`, `kotoba migration parity`) are pre-existing on origin/main itself, unrelated to its diff.")
  (:adr/consequences (vector "projects/ no longer contains ~9GB of orphaned pre-west submodule clones."
                      "Every session now gets an automatic, unconditional ahead/behind-vs-origin/main check at startup instead of relying on the agent remembering a prose rule."
                      "PR #828 (130 files, the only genuinely-unlanded content from the 848-commit divergence) remains open pending human review of its exclusions before merge."
                      "No further west-multirepo folder-cleanup work is currently known to be outstanding in the scope originally asked about (gftdcojp root / app-aozora / kotoba-lang / etzhayyim root) — the great majority of the work this session set out to do had already been completed by other concurrent sessions before or during investigation, a recurring pattern worth noting for future planning in this heavily-concurrent workspace."))
  (:adr/body "# ADR-2607206700\n\nAudited this superproject and several child repos for monorepo-era (numbered-folder) leftovers relative to the west-manifest multirepo model. Removed ~9GB of orphaned pre-west git-submodule clones under `projects/` (preserving one real 172-file WIP branch first). Verified, rather than executed, most of the requested refactor: app-aozora, gftdcojp/ai-gftd-apps-gftdcojp, jk-luxury/club-shinshi, kotoba-lang (1583 repos), and etzhayyim/root's `60-apps` (248 dirs) were each found to already be compliant or mid-migration via other concurrent sessions' work landing during this same investigation. Separately fixed and permanently guarded against a real incident: the working branch `agent/pin-docs-edn-only` had silently diverged 848 commits from `origin/main`; its backup is preserved on its own remote branch, its genuinely-novel content (130 files) is in open PR #828, and a new `SessionStart` hook (merged via PR #827) now makes this kind of drift visible every session going forward instead of depending on an agent remembering to check.")))
